If you just want a breathing pacer, you probably don't need a subscription.

Apple's Breathe (in Mindfulness on Apple Watch) is completely free. The Breathing App keeps slow resonance breathing free forever with no account. iBreathe lets you build box or 4-7-8 patterns for free, with ads.

We compared five apps field by field, with prices checked 3 Nov 2026. We make DeRot and didn't rank it. {url}
